"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(node (ref \\\"U1\\\") (pin \\\"2\\\") (pinfunction \\\"VO\\\") (pintype \\\"power_out\\\")) ... (node (ref \\\"C2\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\") ...) on net +5V\"}, {\"source\": \"spice\", \"quote\": \"C2 +5V 0 100n\"}], \"impact\": \"The 5 V rail may oscillate or be unstable under load, affecting both MCUs and the fan supply.\", \"confidence\": 0.2}], \"summary\": \"The netlist's decoupling and reset arrangement looks suspicious: C3 sits between the +5V rail and RST instead of RST and GND, and the LM1117 output has only a 100nF capacitor. The C3 reset-network issue is the most likely deviation from sound practice.\"}",
